{"unit_id":"tag:0GJ1:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为对象（object），属于<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>为几何点（geometric point），位于<MATH_0004>上，不属于开集（open）<MATH_0005>。则\n<MATH_0006>\n由命题<REF_0001>，并且因为茎（stalk），对于<MATH_0007>在<MATH_0008>处而言，由引理<REF_0002>为零。另一方面，有\n<MATH_0009>\n由引理<REF_0003>和<REF_0004>。因此，由刻画<MATH_0010>的引理<REF_0005>可知<MATH_0011>。我们略去该对应对<MATH_0012>具有函子性（functorial）的验证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开集"},{"source_term":"stalk","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开集","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"stalk","target_term":"茎","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"functorial","target_term":"函子性","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:05BE:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n看来这是公认的定义。另一种方案更容易推广到平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）位点（site），对于概形（scheme）而言，之外：以\n<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>\n为起点来定义可构造层（constructible sheaves），其中<MATH_0004>遍历所有拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的对象（objects），属于<MATH_0005>，再取最小的满子范畴（full subcategory），属于<MATH_0006>、<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>，包含这些并对有限极限（finite limits）及余极限（colimits）封闭。由引理<REF_0001>以及引理<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>和<REF_0004>可知，这样得到的范畴（category）相同，若<MATH_0009>拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）。但一般而言，这样得到的范畴（category）并不相同。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n不交并（disjoint union）分解（decomposition）<MATH_0010>，将概形（scheme）分解为局部闭子概形（closed subschemes），称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>划分（partition）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对应于<MATH_0011>（与拓扑（Topology），第<REF_0005>节比较）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"constructible sheaves","target_term":"可构造层"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴"},{"source_term":"finite limits","target_term":"有限极限"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"decomposition","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_te