{"unit_id":"tag:09YR:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为拟紧（quasi-compact）且拟分离（quasi-separated）的概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为层（sheaf），其值为集合（sets）、阿贝尔群（abelian groups）或<MATH_0003>-模（modules）（其中<MATH_0004>为 Noether（Noetherian）的），定义于<MATH_0005>上。若存在可构造（constructible）的局部闭子概形（closed subschemes）<MATH_0006>，使得(a)<MATH_0007>且(b)<MATH_0008>可构造（constructible），则<MATH_0009>可构造（constructible）。\n","allowed_english":["Noether","a","b"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"quasi-separated","target_term":"拟分离","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"Noether","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"局部闭子概形","context":"原文以 locally 修饰；暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09YS:proof","translation":"(1)的证明。设<MATH_0001>为划分（partition），对应于<MATH_0002>，其各项为局部闭（locally closed）的可构造（constructible）子概形（subschemes），使得<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>在各部分上均有限（finite）且局部常值（locally constant）（使用引理<REF_0001>，对<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>都使用，并选择共同加细（refinement））。再应用引理<REF_0002>于限制（restriction），将映射（map）限制到每个部分。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n(2)和(3)的证明略去。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造"},{"source_term":"subschemes","target_term":"子概形"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"partition","target_term":"划分","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"locally closed","target_term":"局部闭","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"constructible","target_term":"可构造","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"subschemes","target_term":"子概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"locally constant","target_term":"局部常值","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"restriction","target_term":"限制","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
